// Badge ontology tags to pre-compiled .wasm modules generated by KNIRVHASHER.
//
// This implements Step 1 of the WASM Integration Investigation:
//
//	Map "Guardrail" tags in Badges to rules.wasm.
//	Map "Resolution/Recovery" tags in Badges to resolution.wasm.
//
// WASM binaries are produced by the KNIRVHASHER transformer pipeline
// (packages/KNIRVHASHER/pkg/hashing/transformer/compiler.go) and stored
// in a configurable output directory (default /var/heart/wasm/).  Each
// .wasm file is named by its SHA-256 hash.
//
// Badge-to-tag-to-WASM mapping is persisted so that subsequent guardrail
// evaluations and eBPF-triggered resolutions can look up the correct
// WASM module without re-scanning the directory.
